' 4+1 development view - Development view · deploy, production data and keepalive pipelines (deploy.yml, prod-data.yml, keepalive.yml)
' Version 1.1 - 2026-11-10
' For: whoever is going to change the code or deploy.
' Documented decision: a read query against the database twice a week (keepalive.yml) stops Supabase from pausing the free project for inactivity; migrations run in GitHub Actions as the schema owner, before the API; Render and Vercel are called only with green CI on main; the production data commands are a manual workflow (ADR 0009).
' Not drawn: classes, endpoints and business rules; the repository secrets and variables (they are in docs/deployment/environment-variables.md).
@startuml development-deploy
!include ../style.puml
title Development view - deploy, production data and keepalive pipelines (.github/workflows/deploy.yml, prod-data.yml, keepalive.yml)

start
fork
  partition "Deploy · after green CI on a push to main · ubuntu-latest" {
    :Runs only with DEPLOY_ENABLED = true\nand with the commit of the CI run;
    :migrate: install the .NET SDK\ndotnet tool restore + dotnet restore;
    :Migration bundle\ndotnet ef migrations bundle\n./efbundle as the schema owner;
    :deploy-api: Render deploy hook\ncalls the Render deploy hook for this commit;
    :Waits for 200 on the API's /health (up to 6 minutes);
    :deploy-web: Vercel CLI\npull, build ~-~-prod, deploy ~-~-prebuilt;
    :smoke: the site and the API answer 200;
  }
fork again
  partition "Production data · manual (workflow_dispatch) · ubuntu-latest" {
    :Runs only with DEPLOY_ENABLED = true;
    if (action?) then (migrate-only)
      :Migration bundle\nbuild and ./efbundle;
    elseif (set-admin-password) then
      :dotnet run -- set-admin-password;
    else (seed-demo)
      :dotnet run -- seed-demo\nDemoData__AllowInProduction=true;
    endif
  }
fork again
  partition "Keepalive · Mondays and Thursdays 07:23 UTC, and manual · ubuntu-latest" {
    :Runs only with DEPLOY_ENABLED = true;
    :GET SITE_URL/api/localities?keepalive=<time>\nCache-Control: no-cache, up to 130 s per request;
    :If it fails, retries every 20 s for about 5 minutes;
    :HTTP 200 with a JSON body = the database answered\n(goes through the Vercel rewrite and wakes the API on Render);
  }
end fork
:deploy.yml and prod-data.yml share the concurrency group "deploy"\n(they never run at the same time, without cancelling the one running);
:keepalive.yml has its own group, "keepalive";
stop

@enduml
